title: Avocent ACS: Power supplies
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/avocent
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-avocent-snmp
description:
 Monitors the power supplies of an Avocent ACS 8000 console server through
 ACS8000-MIB (acsPowerSupplyStatePw1 and acsPowerSupplyStatePw2). The service
 is OK if the power supply is on and CRIT if it is off. A power supply that was
 discovered and is later reported as not installed is CRIT too.

item:
 The number of the power supply, "1" or "2".

discovery:
 One service is created per installed power supply.
